    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You unleash an aura with a 30-foot radius, awakening boldness in friendly creatures. Until the creation ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. While in the aura, each friendly creature in the aura (including you) deals an extra 1d6 damage with its weapon attacks. The damage type is the type of the weapons wielded.</p>",
